[RSTIB:migration] 2026-01-22 17:59:38 | INFO | Tool Task called with {'description': 'Fix RSTIB bugs from testing', 'prompt': "Apply bug fixes to RSTIB model based on test results.\n\n**Test Results Summary:**\n- Import/Initialization: ✓ PASS\n- Forward Pass (CPU): ✓ PASS  \n- Loss Calculation: ✗ FAIL (tensor shape mismatch)\n- GPU Training: ✗ FAIL (device placement error)\n- DNE Feature: ✗ FAIL (batch key check error)\n\n**Three Critical Bugs to Fix:**\n\n### Bug #1: Tensor Shape Mismatch in Loss Calculation\n**File:** `Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/model/traffic_speed_prediction/RSTIB.py`\n**Line:** ~406-407 (in calculate_loss method)\n\n**Current Code (WRONG):**\n```python\ny_true_noisy = y_true_inv + noise_y.squeeze(-1).transpose(1, 2)\ny_predicted_noisy = y_predicted_inv + noise_y.squeeze(-1).transpose(1, 2)\n```\n\n**Problem:** Creates shape [B, N, T] instead of [B, T, N, 1]\n\n**Fixed Code:**\n```python\ny_true_noisy = y_true_inv + noise_y\ny_predicted_noisy = y_predicted_inv + noise_y\n```\n\n---\n\n### Bug #2: Device Placement Error\n**File:** `Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/model/traffic_speed_prediction/RSTIB.py`\n**Line:** ~244 (in reparameterize_n method)\n\n**Current Code (WRONG):**\n```python\neps = Variable(cuda(std.data.new(std.size()).normal_(), std.is_cuda)).to(self.device)\n```\n\n**Problem:** Uses cuda() function that may not respect self.device\n\n**Fixed Code:**\n```python\neps = std.data.new(std.size()).normal_().to(self.device)\n```\n\n---\n\n### Bug #3: Batch Key Check Error  \n**File:** `Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/model/traffic_speed_prediction/RSTIB.py`\n**Line:** ~298 (in forward method)\n\n**Current Code (WRONG):**\n```python\nif self.if_dne and 'te' in batch:\n    dne = self.construct_dne(batch['te'].type(torch.LongTensor))\n    node_emb.append(dne)\n```\n\n**Problem:** Batch class doesn't implement __contains__, causes KeyError\n\n**Fixed Code:**\n```python\nif self.if_dne:\n    try:\n        if hasattr(batch, 'data') and 'te' in batch.data:\n            dne = self.construct_dne(batch['te'].type(torch.LongTensor))\n            node_emb.append(dne)\n    except (KeyError, AttributeError):\n        pass  # DNE not available, skip\n```\n\n---\n\n**Your Tasks:**\n\n1. Apply all three bug fixes to RSTIB.py\n2. Verify the fixes don't break existing functionality\n3. Check for any related issues in the same areas\n4. Confirm the file saves correctly\n5. Test that model still imports\n\n**Additional checks while fixing:**\n- Ensure all tensor operations maintain correct shapes\n- Verify device placement is consistent throughout\n- Check error handling is robust\n\nReport back with:\n- Confirmation that all 3 fixes are applied\n- Any additional issues found while fixing\n- Whether model still imports successfully\n- Line numbers of the changes made", 'subagent_type': 'model-adapter'}
