[DSTAGNN:migration] 2026-01-29 17:37:50 | INFO | Tool Bash called with {'command': "cat > /tmp/model_class_summary.txt << 'EOF'\n===== DSTAGNN MODEL CLASS HIERARCHY =====\n\nClass: DSTAGNN_submodule (nn.Module)\n├── BlockList: nn.ModuleList\n│   ├── DSTAGNN_block[0] with (num_of_d=in_channels, nb_chev_filter, nb_time_filter, time_strides=1)\n│   ├── DSTAGNN_block[1:] with (num_of_d=in_channels*nb_time_filter, nb_chev_filter, nb_time_filter, time_strides=1)\n│   └── ... repeated for nb_block times\n├── final_conv: Conv2d(int((len_input/time_strides)*nb_block), 128, kernel=(1, nb_time_filter))\n└── final_fc: Linear(128, num_for_predict)\n\nClass: DSTAGNN_block (nn.Module)\n├── pre_conv: Conv2d(num_of_timesteps, d_model, (1, num_of_d))\n├── EmbedT: Embedding (Temporal positional embedding)\n├── EmbedS: Embedding (Spatial positional embedding)\n├── TAt: MultiHeadAttention (Temporal attention)\n├── SAt: SMultiHeadAttention (Spatial attention)\n├── cheb_conv_SAt: cheb_conv_withSAt (Graph convolution with attention)\n├── gtu3, gtu5, gtu7: GTU modules (Temporal convolutions)\n├── pooling: MaxPool2d\n├── residual_conv: Conv2d(in_channels, nb_time_filter, (1,1), stride=(1, time_strides))\n├── dropout: Dropout(0.05)\n├── fcmy: Linear(3*num_of_timesteps-12, num_of_timesteps)\n└── ln: LayerNorm(nb_time_filter)\n\nKey Modules:\n- MultiHeadAttention: Temporal attention with residual connections\n- SMultiHeadAttention: Spatial attention (queries and keys only)\n- cheb_conv_withSAt: K-order Chebyshev GCN with learned spatial attention masks\n- GTU: Gated Temporal Unit with Conv2d + Tanh + Sigmoid\n- Embedding: Positional embeddings for time and space\n\n===== FORWARD FLOW =====\n\nInput: (batch_size, num_vertices, num_features, num_timesteps)\n  ↓\nFor each DSTAGNN_block:\n  ├─ Temporal Embedding & Attention\n  ├─ Spatial Embedding & Attention\n  ├─ Graph Convolution with attention-weighted adjacency\n  ├─ Multi-kernel temporal convolution (GTUs 3,5,7)\n  ├─ Residual connection + LayerNorm\n  └─ Output: (batch_size, num_vertices, num_features, num_timesteps)\n  ↓\nConcatenate outputs from all blocks\n  ↓\nFinal Conv2d projection to 128 channels\n  ↓\nFinal Linear layer to num_for_predict steps\n  ↓\nOutput: (batch_size, num_vertices, num_for_predict)\n\n===== GRAPH MATRICES USED =====\n\nadj_mx: Base adjacency matrix (num_vertices x num_vertices)\n  - Chebyshev polynomials computed from this\n  - Used for structural connectivity\n\nadj_pa: Spatial-Temporal Relevance Graph (STRG) (num_vertices x num_vertices)\n  - Multiplied with learned attention masks\n  - Represents correlation from data\n\nadj_TMD: Spatial-Temporal Aware Graph (STAG) (optional, if graph='AG')\n  - Alternative to adj_mx for graph selection\n\n===== KEY PARAMETERS =====\n\nd_model: Embedding dimension (512)\nd_k: Attention dimension for K and Q (32)\nd_v: Attention dimension for V (32, typically = d_k)\nn_heads: Number of temporal attention heads (3)\nK: Chebyshev polynomial order / spatial attention heads (3)\nnb_chev_filter: Output channels of cheb_conv_withSAt (32)\nnb_time_filter: Output channels of GTU (32)\nnb_block: Number of DSTAGNN blocks (4)\nin_channels: Input feature channels (1 for traffic flow)\nnum_of_vertices: Number of nodes in graph (307 for PEMS04)\nnum_for_predict: Prediction horizon (12 timesteps)\nlen_input: Input sequence length (12 timesteps)\nEOF\ncat /tmp/model_class_summary.txt\n", 'description': 'Create model class structure summary'}
