ory_data, long_history_data)\n   - Handle adjacency matrix from data_feature\n\n4. **Register Model**: Update `Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/model/__init__.py` and appropriate task-specific `__init__.py`\n\n5. **Handle Pre-trained Weights**:\n   - Ensure paths for loading TMAE/SMAE weights are configurable\n   - Freeze pre-trained parameters during fine-tuning\n   - Support both pre-training and fine-tuning modes\n\n**Reference**: LibCity expects models at Bigscity-LibCity path to inherit AbstractTrafficStateModel with predict(), calculate_loss(), and forward() methods.", 'subagent_type': 'model-adapter'}
