ning logic\n\n### 4. Handle Special Features\n- Adaptive graph learning\n- Self-supervised deviation learning\n- Spatio-temporal embeddings (STE)\n- Multi-support graph processing\n\n### 5. Register Model\nAdd to `Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/model/traffic_speed_prediction/__init__.py`:\n```python\nfrom libcity.model.traffic_speed_prediction.STSSDL import STSSDL\n```\n\n## Expected Outputs\n1. Created file: `Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/model/traffic_speed_prediction/STSSDL.py`\n2. Updated: `Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/model/traffic_speed_prediction/__init__.py`\n3. Report any challenges or assumptions made during adaptation\n\nReference the LibCity documentation provided in the coordinator's context for implementation patterns.", 'subagent_type': 'model-adapter'}
